```mermaid
flowchart LR
    Client[Cliente Web ou Mobile]
    API[FastAPI API]
    DeckService[DeckService]
    CardService[CardService]
    DeckRepo[DeckRepository]
    CardRepo[CardRepository]
    DB[(Banco de Dados)]
    LLM[LLM Provider opcional]

    BulkEndpoint[POST /decks/:deck_id/cards/bulk]
    BulkPayload[cards: array de CardInput]
    CardInput[CardInput: front back source]
    PersistBulk[Persistencia em lote 1..N cards]

    Client --> API
    Client --> BulkEndpoint --> API

    API --> DeckService --> DeckRepo --> DB
    API --> CardService
    CardService --> CardRepo --> DB
    CardService --> DeckRepo

    API -->|gera cards via IA opcional| LLM
    LLM -->|retorna cards array| API

    API --> BulkPayload --> CardInput --> CardService
    BulkEndpoint -->|deck_id no path ou no payload| CardService
    CardService --> PersistBulk --> CardRepo
```
